  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "The sources are a short company profile and a fall office catering menu for Salvia Kitchen.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_14c571909ec6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_14c571909ec6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ana and her brother Tomas run the business, which opened its commercial kitchen in 2022.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_14c571909ec6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year they catered 214 events and served about 9,600 guests, mostly office lunches and baby showers.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_14c571909ec6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Boxed lunches cost $16 per person with a 10-box minimum, and family-style trays cost $24 per person for at least 15 guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Orders need 72 hours notice, and delivery is free within 10 miles of downtown or $35 beyond that.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Salvia Kitchen served about 9,600 guests at 214 events last year. Trays come only in sizes for 15, 25 or 40 guests. How do they handle events larger than 40 guests?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_14c571909ec6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Baby showers are a main source of business, but the fall menu is built for offices, with a 10-box minimum. What do baby shower clients order?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_14c571909ec6"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Every menu can be made gluten-free, but the salad uses farro and the tortas use a bolillo roll. What replaces them within the 72 hours notice window?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_1c925bb74531"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
